      "title": "Advance none under this strict measured screen",
      "detail": "There are19/23 heuristic gaps,1/2 dry non-steep zero-proxy-impact cases, and zero cases combining those filters with positive current-painted-cell yield. This supports no candidate selection from this screen, not a proof no legal local road can improve capacity."
