      ],
      "title": "actualGap is a sampled road-mask heuristic",
      "detail": "interiorRoadSamples<=2 tolerates up to2 hits between12% and88% of the segment. No graph path/midpoint connectivity test or exact continuous crossing check is performed; narrow crossings or mask bleed may be misclassified. Filtered-out pairs are not all proven midpoint duplicates."
    },
    {
      "rank": 3,
      "owner": "verification tooling",
      "supportingOwners": [
        "terrain",
        "zoning"
      ],
      "title": "Slope and affected-lot tests are screening proxies",
      "detail": ".38 is the existing Democity zone-paint filter, not a general road-placement prohibition. Endpoint radius24m and expanded corridor membership identify potential contact, not proven destruction/change of those lots. Risk counts do not establish that an actual road necessarily trades away them."
    },
    {
      "rank": 4,
      "owner": "verification tooling",
      "supportingOwners": [
        "zoning"
      ],
      "title": "Yield uses existing painted unclaimed stock and approximate new-road sampling",
      "detail": "It samples at12m end offsets in8m steps and uses fixed widths/depths, without real new-road frontage trims/pad, terrain refresh, corner extensions or zone repaint. It excludes any newly available or newly painted cells. predictedUniqueKeys includes full-depth run keys even when the run yields zero lots; it is not emitted parcel area."
    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "All316 candidate records were read, cardinal adjacency/length checked and Boolean classifications recomputed. Yield totals were recomputed as sums of stored side estimates; primitive terrain/road samples and raw hypothetical slot arrays are not retained, so those live measurements are not independently reproducible from this JSON alone.",
